<section class="section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2 id="work-title">Sci pop leads what we make.</h2>
      <p style="margin-top:18px">Sci pop is pop music built from real science. It leads the creative work the studio is developing now, with music first.</p>
      <ul class="made-list">
        <li><h3>Kangaroo Time</h3><p>WELI's music video, made from his PhD research on wild eastern grey kangaroos. It made WELI the AAAS Dance Your PhD Overall Winner 2024, and its reception started the studio.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Animal sounds for sci pop</h3><p>Our current project curates researchers' field recordings of animals and isolates their calls for new sci pop music. Supported by the ACT Government through artsACT.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Close Listening</h3><p>Software we are building to hear, see and cleanly lift an animal's call out of a long field recording.</p></li>
        <li><h3>A credited sound library</h3><p>Every sound we use carries the names of the researchers, papers and institutions behind it.</p></li>
      </ul>
      <p>The framework is set out in the studio's founding paper, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21387515" rel="noopener">Sci pop: science as aesthetic, theme and method in contemporary popular music</a> (open access, Zenodo, CC BY 4.0).</p>
      <p class="more"><a href="/sci-pop/">What is sci pop</a><a href="/news/dance-your-phd-2024/">The AAAS win</a><a href="/wildwoohoo-x-weli/">WildWooHoo x WELI</a></p>
    </div>
